  "title": "The Ceasefire That Wasn't",
  "standfirst": "US strikes on Iran shattered a fragile truce and sent crude up more than 20%. The Fed held for a fifth straight meeting with three dissents, the IMF trimmed global growth to 3.0%, and the AI trade had its worst month in over a year.",
